e registry\n   March 2026, next due 2027.\n2. Sidhu-Mann, Harpreet   DOB 22-Jun-1991   Lic. 160027-418  Class 1, 9 yrs\n   1 speeding, Traffic Safety Act s. 115(2)(p), 11 Feb 2025, 3 demerits.\n3. Cardinal, Tyrell J.   DOB 03/12/1999   Lic. 171884-203  Class 3, GDL exit 2019\n   At-fault loss Jan 22, 2026, U-03 backed into a loader at the Gull Lake pit,\n   claim AMC-26-0044187, paid $18,640.17 (repair at Ponoka Truck & Trailer Repair,\n   invoice PT-9917). Roadside suspension, 3 days, July 2024 - personal vehicle.\n   Insurer will rate him as Class 3 only, not to drive the B-train.\n4. Hrynkiw, Bogdan   DOB 1957-11-28   Lic. 102256-930  Class 1, 40+ yrs\n   Impaired driving conviction, Criminal Code s. 320.14, 2021 (personal vehicle); licence reinstated\n   14 Sept 2022 with interlock, removed 2023. EXCLUDED DRIVER endorsement signed 2025-09-30\n   - he works the scale house only. Bogdan is the dispatcher's father.\n5. Makokis, Curtis   DOB 07 Jan 1985   Lic. 155610-774  Class 1, 12 yrs\n   Clean. Hired May 4/26. Lives on Samson Cree Nation; mailing address\n   Box 219, Maskwacis AB T0C 1N0.\nNot a driver: Oksana Hrynkiw, dispatcher / office, 403-555-0122, oksana@wolfcreekhauling.example.\nShe has the fleet card file: fuel cards are in the company's name, but the shop Visa\nending 0415 is in Dwayne's own name (limit $15,000).\n\nNotes for underwriter:\n- Carrier Profile R-Factor 0.412, Safety Fitness Certificate SFC-0098142, last CVSA\n  inspection June 9, no out-of-service.\n- Telematics in U-01 and U-02 only (units GT-7C41A9, GT-7C41B2).\n- Mr. Lagacé asked whether excluding Tyrell from the tractors lowers the premium; quote both ways.\n- Pre-authorized debit: transit 08829, inst. 219, acct 1004417 at the credit union\n  in Lacombe. Void cheque on file. Signed application needed back by Sept. 12.\n                                                             - LP", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "535 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Leanne Poitras", "Dwa